Bilkul. Ab hum frontend ko proper SaaS production-level structure me banayenge. Pehle sirf folders aur files create karenge, coding baad me start karenge.

Tumhara backend ka scope clear hai:

Public Landing Website
Authentication
User Dashboard
Projects
API Keys
Templates
Email Sending
Email Logs
Analytics
Settings
Admin Panel

Isliye frontend bhi module-based architecture me rakhenge.

