Ab create karne ka order:

Pehle ye banao:

Step 1:
src/
assets/
components/
layouts/
routes/
services/
hooks/
context/
utils/
modules/
Step 2:

modules ke andar:

landing
auth
dashboard
projects
apiKeys
templates
email
emailLogs
analytics
settings
admin
Step 3:

Har module ke andar:

pages/
components/
routes file

