Ye sequence tumhare backend architecture se bhi perfectly match karta hai aur industry-standard SaaS frontend development flow bhi follow karta hai.

Agla step: Phase 1 se shuruaat karte hain aur pehle ek modern SaaS landing page banayenge (hero, navbar, features, pricing, testimonials, FAQ, footer), uske baad authentication screens par jayenge.